# Used only by the indexer build, whose context is the repository root. Allowlist: the
# image gets exactly what indexer/Dockerfile copies, never .git, corpus/raw or a venv.
*
!indexer/requirements.txt
!indexer/pipeline
!corpus/fetch.py
!corpus/sources.yaml
!corpus/MANIFEST.md
!eval/fixtures
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
